# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Mga tagubilin sa pag-install {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Una, piliin kung paano mo patatakbuhin at ii-install ang mga package. May dalawang pangunahing paraan para dito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Option 1: Mag-install mula sa PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from Source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Option 2: Mag-install mula sa Source](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Una, gumawa ng minimal na environment na Python lang ang naka-install. Inirerekomenda naming gumamit ng [Python virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang bago mong environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Option 1: Mag-install mula sa PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-slc` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Ang pinakasimpleng paraan para i-install ang package na `qiskit-addon-slc` ay sa pamamagitan ng `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Option 2: Mag-install mula sa Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, install from source.\n"
msgstr "Kung plano mong mag-develop sa repository o patakbuhin ang mga notebook nang lokal, mag-install mula sa source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-slc` repository.\n"
msgstr "Kung gayon, ang unang hakbang ay i-clone ang repository na `qiskit-addon-slc`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade `pip` and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-upgrade ang `pip` at pumasok sa repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-slc` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you plan to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Ang susunod na hakbang ay i-install ang `qiskit-addon-slc` sa virtual environment. I-install ang mga dependency ng notebook kung balak mong patakbuhin ang lahat ng visualization sa mga notebook. Kung balak mong mag-develop sa repository, i-install ang mga dependency na `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ayusin ang mga opsyon sa ibaba ayon sa pangangailangan mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Kung na-install mo ang mga dependency ng notebook, makakapagsimula ka sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng mga notebook sa docs.\n"
